-- Requeue the ~500 thin freeTemplatesLegacyBatch2.ts titles for a real AI redraft via the
-- existing weekly-template pipeline (lib/templateWeekly.ts) — see
-- marketing/seo-research/queue-legacy-batch-redraft.mjs. Same slugs as the current static
-- entries in apps/web/src/lib/freeTemplatesLegacyBatch2.ts; once a row here reaches
-- status='published', that slug's static entry is removed so the URL falls through to the
-- richer, dynamic marketplace_templates row instead (see FreeTemplateDetail.tsx).
-- Chunked into 50-row statements — a single 500-row INSERT exceeds D1's per-statement
-- size limit (SQLITE_TOOBIG).
